    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      478.15,
      298.21,
      541.22
    ],
    "text": "I, Kuragamage Don Lal Kantha, Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Land and Irrigation, hereby declare under Sub section (1) of the Section 5 of the Land Acquisition Act, that the lands described below are needed for a public purpose and will be acquired under the provisions of the said Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      556.15,
      298.22,
      645.22
    ],
    "text": "The following land parcels are delineated and bounded as shown in Progress Line No. GM/DIV/2023/138, dated 30.03.2023, prepared by the Surveyor General, These Land parcels are situated in Balagalla Village, within the Balagalla West Grama Niladhari Division, Divulapitiya Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division, Gampaha District, Western Province, and are bounded as follows:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
